Niri 侧笺 (Niri Side Note)

This is an unofficial Simplified Chinese fork of Stickies:
  https://github.com/0atxl/stickies

Upstream copyright and license notices are preserved in LICENSE and in the
source files. The fork's modifications are distributed under the same
MPL-2.0 license. The complete corresponding source is this repository.

The internal application ID and XDG data paths remain "stickies" so that
existing notes and configuration keep working; the product name, package
name and executable are "Niri 侧笺" / "niri-side-note".
